# Online match on the local platform, the guest's side (bob, a phone): Quick
# join a match, then play by keys to the result the server script records.
# viewport 390x844@2
until 900 =Online Match
frames 400
touch =Online Match
until 300 =Quick join a match
frames 10
touch =Quick join a match
until 3600 =Dive!
frames 20
save online-guest-keep
repeat 60000 until Result recorded by the StarHermit server.
  key Enter 1
  frames 6
  key Enter 1
  frames 40
end
expect =You lose
frames 30
save online-guest-results
